v 3.0.4
d {bf:GSHEET}: Import a public Google Sheet directly to Stata via Python Integration
d
d Use the Python Integration available in Stata 16+ to import a public
d Google Sheet by URL. Google Sheet must be shared with public permissions, 
d that is, the sheet sharing is set to "Anyone with the link can view".
d 
d Requires: Stata 16+ with functioning Python Integration, pandas and numpy Python packages
d 
d Author: Kenneth Elpus
d Support: provided as is with no support offered
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260513
d
f gsheet.ado
f gsheet.sthlp
